OL,3,APolls open across US as voters decide
OL,4,Awho will control Congress for rest of
OL,5,ATrump's term
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's polling day in the US midterms,
OL,8,Fwith millions of Americans voting to
OL,9,Fdecide who will control Congress for
OL,10,Fthe final two years of Donald Trump's
OL,11,Fpresidency
OL,13,FWhat's up for election? See our basic
OL,14,Fexplainer here
OL,16,FTrump's Republican Party currently
OL,17,Fcontrols the two chambers - the House
OL,18,Fof Representatives and the Senate - but
OL,19,FDemocrats are hoping to flip enough
OL,20,Fseats to win a majority in both
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
