OL,3,APolls open across US as voters decide
OL,4,Awho will control Congress for rest of
OL,5,ATrump's term
OL,6,
OL,7,FIf they control Congress, Democrats
OL,8,Fwould be better placed to block Trump's
OL,9,Fplans, and could also launch
OL,10,Finvestigations into the president and
OL,11,Fhis team
OL,13,FPolls are continuing to open across the
OL,14,FUS, the most recent being Idaho,
OL,15,FCalifornia, Oregon and Nevada. Results
OL,16,Fwill start coming in this evening in
OL,17,Fthe US - our quick timetable is here
